Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.68,0:01:48.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Não tem jeito mesmo, Yuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:55.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Aqui estava eu pensando que\N seu único desejo era vingança
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:57.77,Main,,0,0,0,,e de uma hora para outra \Nsua obsessão com a família volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Poder...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:02.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Está tão desesperado assim por poder?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:05.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.10,0:02:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,,eu preciso.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu preciso salvar o Guren.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:13.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Me dê poder, Ashuramaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:17.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Claro, te darei quanto poder quiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:20.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Afinal, são os seus\N desejos que me alimentam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.55,0:02:23.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Antes disso...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:26.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Você deveria parar de tomar aquelas pílulas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:31.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Elas suprimem seus desejos enquanto forçam a maldição a tomar conta do seu corpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,É um pouco contraditório, mas funciona.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Um bando de pílulas qualquer \Nnão vai te dar força a troco de nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Então, o que eu devo fazer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:46.82,Main,,0,0,0,,O que eu preciso fazer para ficar mais forte?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:50.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Infelizmente, é tarde demais.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.22,0:02:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Você já morreu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:54.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu num instante.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.95,0:03:00.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Aquelas pílulas destruíram seus órgãos vitais e causaram uma parada cardíaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:04.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Mesmo com minhas habilidades \Nregenerativas, o dano é irreversível.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:07.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Acabou, não tem mais volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:09.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Não...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:12.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:14.90,Main,,0,0,0,,...isso é o pós vida?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:18.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu adoraria que fosse isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:21.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Você estaria melhor se fosse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:23.43,Main,,0,0,0,,O que quer dizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:26.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está morto, não há dúvidas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:29.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas, ainda não faleceu... por alguma razão.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:30.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que será?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:35.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Aqueles anjos malditos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:38.09,Main,,0,0,0,,estão te forçando a continuar vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:42.70,Main,,0,0,0,,O que é isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:45.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Vai saber? Para mim parece uma trombeta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:52.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu não a pegaria, se quer saber.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:54.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Você deveria deixá-la onde está.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:57.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Os anjos são piores que nós, demônios, e mais que os humanos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Se seu coração começou a bater novamente,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:05.22,Main,,0,0,0,,então acho que poderei te ajudar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:08.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas eu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:11.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Esqueça, fique comigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:13.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu vou te cu—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:16.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Você não pode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:18.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu quero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:20.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:22.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Ter a mim não é o suficiente?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu te mandei parar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Então me dê seu poder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Que garoto ganancioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:44.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Bem, já te dei o que queria.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.87,0:04:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Aquelas três pílulas que você\N tomou ainda estão fazendo efeito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Você ainda tem alguns minutos para usar meu poder antes de se transformar num demônio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Vá em frente, Yuu. Tente.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Abra seus olhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:17.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:17.34,Main Alt,,0,0,0,,Yuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:18.90,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yuu! Você...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Voltei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:27.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Tenho que ir agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:31.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:33.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:34.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos, abra logo a boca.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Como vocês conseguiram esse poder?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:59.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Uma deusa o deu a nós.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:04.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Não o mate, Chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele é importante, então tome mais cuidado.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:09.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:12.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Então, vamos tentar de novo, só que com cuidado.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:26.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã? Que poder é esse?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:28.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Me devolva...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,...o Guren!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:33.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Deveras impressionante.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:35.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Não posso fazer nada, mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:40.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Você ainda é humano?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:42.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Ashura Kannon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:43.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Três Espadas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.78,0:06:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Espada,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:46.79,Main,,0,0,0,,beba meu sangue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.05,0:06:56.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Já terminou?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, mas você já!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:09.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Bem, não tenho escolha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:22.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Guren?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:25.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Opa, quase.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:27.18,Main,,0,0,0,,O que está fazendo aqui?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Apresse-se e vá embora daqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:30.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:33.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:37.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que o poder que eu\N tenho não é suficiente?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:41.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é óbvio? Você não passa de gado.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:45.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Cale-se.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:49.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Não importa o quanto negue, \Nvocê sempre será gado.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:51.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Cale-se.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.61,Main,,0,0,0,,No final, gado não passa de ga—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:58.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Cale-se!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:04.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Interessante, \Nvocê ficou mais rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:08.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Pare, Yuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:10.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Não use mais poder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:12.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Você será possuído pelo demônio!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:14.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Demônio, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:17.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,É o suficiente, Yuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:27.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Cale a boca, Guren!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:28.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu vim te salvar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirralho,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:32.24,Main,,0,0,0,,eu já disse que era tarde demais para mim!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:34.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Não me diga isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:38.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Você me mandou continuar vivendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:41.62,Main,,0,0,0,,E eu não posso fazer isso se \Nvocê não estiver aqui para me mostrar como é!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:47.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Escuta, Yuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu tenho meu próprio plano,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:50.71,Main,,0,0,0,,então—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou desistir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:56.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Me dê mais poder, Ashuramaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Vai continuar mesmo depois de tudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Já que quer tanto, vou te matar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:05.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Não importa se você é importante para\N o animal de estimação de alguém.{Ele está falando do Mika que é o pet da Krul}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:07.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Mais...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:09.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Mais!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:10.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Guren...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:12.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Meus amigos...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:14.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Me dê poder para protegê-los!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:17.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Por favor! Já chega, Yuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:18.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Me dê mais!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:19.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Mais!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:21.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Mais, mais!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:22.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Me dê mais poder!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom garoto, Yuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:28.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu te darei quanto poder você quiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:32.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Ceda ao seu desejo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Mais, mais, mais...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:37.22,Main,,0,0,0,,E então...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Não deixe seu desejo te consumir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:40.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Resista, Yuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Torne-se um demônio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:10:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Agora, que tal tentarmos de novo, vampiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:05.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Abra o sarcófago na contagem de novo, Kiseki-ou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:12.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:13.09,Main,,0,0,0,,dois,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:14.13,Main,,0,0,0,,três...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:15.88,Main,,0,0,0,,O que é aquilo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Kimizuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:21.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Não se intrometa, Kimizuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:23.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele é meu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.05,0:10:28.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Sete,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.57,0:10:30.69,Main,,0,0,0,,oito...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:32.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, espera!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:34.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Desapareça!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Cara, que saco.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:53.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirralhos, isso é uma ordem!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.95,0:10:57.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Não importa o que aconteça,\N fiquem vivos! Saiam daqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:04.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ótimo, funcionou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:07.30,Main,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:08.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu explico depois.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:09.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisamos sair daqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.17,0:11:14.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Kimizuki-san, o que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,É a habilidade do Kiseki-ou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Posso capturar qualquer \Ncoisa que escute a contagem completa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:21.61,Main,,0,0,0,,E o Tenente-Coronel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:23.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:25.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Por aqui, rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:27.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Os reforços inimigos chegaram!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:33.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Demoraram demais, pirralhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:37.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Estamos indo para o ponto de encontro agora!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.47,0:12:13.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Krul-sama, chegaremos aos aposentos de Crowley Eusford em breve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Entendido.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é o grupo do Lacus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:25.40,Main,,0,0,0,,São os vampiros de Kyoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:28.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Preciso terminar tudo\N antes da chegada deles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:39.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Major-General, inimigo à frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:41.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Quantos?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:42.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Então nós o abateremos!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Todos, em posição!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.38,0:12:49.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Há mais algum vampiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:51.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Podemos dar conta já que é apenas um.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:55.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Protegeremos o Yuu-san \Naté que tudo tenha acabado.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,O Yuu-chan virá comigo,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:11.89,Main,,0,0,0,,humanos!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:27.25,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pessoal, vamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:28.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.13,0:13:31.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, Mika-nii, Yuu-nii, até depois.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Tá bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:34.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Até!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:36.64,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\be2}Tchau!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Estamos indo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:40.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Comida grátis, comida grátis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:42.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Comida, comida!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.18,0:13:43.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Vamos comer bastante!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.73,0:13:46.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Você vai acabar caindo se não for mais devagar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.45,0:13:51.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, Yuu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Estou ocupado.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:54.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, ei, ei, Yuu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.31,0:13:55.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Você é chato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:56.95,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi, Mika?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:14:01.95,Main,,0,0,0,,O que você faria se\N conseguíssemos fugir daqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:03.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.56,0:14:05.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Do que você está falando, idiota?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:08.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Não tem nada lá fora além daquele vírus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.38,0:14:12.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Apenas pense nisso.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:18.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Já imaginou conseguir sair daqui e viver uma vida tranquila com nossa família num mundo sem vampiros,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:20.35,Main,,0,0,0,,não seria bem legal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.89,0:14:23.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Só nós?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:25.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, só nossa família.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:28.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Bem, acho que seria divertido, mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:29.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:31.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, com certeza.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:34.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Então, acho que tenho\N que trabalhar um pouco mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.86,0:14:35.91,Main,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:38.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Nada com o que precise se preocupar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:51.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Ando trabalhando duro \Ntodos os dias, Yuu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.73,0:14:56.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Espada, beba meu sangue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Há apenas um inimigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:01.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Elimine-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.31,0:15:03.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:05.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Beba mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:10.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-chan, estou indo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele está vindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:15.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Formação de batalha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:19.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Genbushin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:38.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele atravessou toda a linha de frente.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:41.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Deve achar que somos fracos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Então, acho melhor provarmos a ele o contrário.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:54.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Nada disso!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:57.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Saiam da frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Não vou deixar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:13.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Agora, mate-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:14.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Vá!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:35.27,Main,,0,0,0,,O que é essa coisa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:37.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Esperem um pouco!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:42.65,Main,,0,0,0,,...é parte da família do Yuu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.09,0:16:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuu-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:00.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuu-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Me devolva...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:11.60,Main,,0,0,0,,...o Yuu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:12.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Espere!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Por favor pare, Mikaela-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,O Yuu-san, nós estamos tentan—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:20.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Cale-se!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.40,0:17:23.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Não vamos te dar ele!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:25.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Estão atrapalhando!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.13,0:17:29.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos embora, Yuu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:37.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Não vou deixar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:38.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Saia logo do meu cami—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.23,0:17:40.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Vai ter que me matar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:42.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas se você faz parte da família do Yuu-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,então também faz parte da minha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:46.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Mika-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:49.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Besteira!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Morra!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:57.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho, Yoichi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.95,0:18:00.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Morra, vampiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Shii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:13.99,Main,,0,0,0,,O-O que você está fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.69,0:18:18.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Se eu deixar você morrer, \No Yuu-san nunca me perdoaria.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.57,0:18:22.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Prefiro que você o pegue e saia daqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:29.53,Main,,0,0,0,,O que você pensa que está fazendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:31.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos te matar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:36.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Não temos tempo para isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Peguem-na!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:44.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Francamente, isso tem que ser uma piada.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:46.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Bem, não temos escolha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:48.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Afinal de contas...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:53.41,Main,,0,0,0,,...nossos amigos vêm em primeiro, não é?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos em frente, pessoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:08.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Amigos?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:10.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Eles disseram "amigos"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.41,0:19:15.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Num mundo como esse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.31,0:19:17.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ei, Mika!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:21.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vem logo brincar com todo mundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.79,0:19:22.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mika-nii!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.89,0:19:23.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mika!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:27.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rápido, Mika-nii!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:34.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuu-chan, eu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:37.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:39.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Essa é a sua chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:42.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Depois que esclarecermos o mal-entendido,\N iremos direto ao aeroporto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.53,0:19:44.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Nos encontraremos de novo lá.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:47.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Encontrar com você novamente?\NPor que eu faria isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:50.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Pronto, já chega disso! Já chega!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:53.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Pode ser só do nosso lado, \Nmas vamos confiar em você.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:54.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Contamos com a sua ajuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:19:59.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Agora, rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:03.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos embora, Yuu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:09.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Esse é um adeus momentâneo, Yuu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:11.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Se tivermos sorte, nos encontra—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.31,0:20:14.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Morra, traidora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:15.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, não a mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.03,0:20:20.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele mandou parar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Se continuar a desobedecer a ordens, então deixe o Esquadrão do Demônio Lunar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:30.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Não fique tão tranquila.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:32.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Você tem muitas explicações a nos dar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Não temos tempo para isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:36.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Os reforços inimigos estão vindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:46.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Vampiros!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Droga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:20:55.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yayoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Maldito!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Kagiyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.31,0:21:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Malditos!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.35,0:21:14.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.51,0:21:16.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Se outro nobre aparecer, acabou!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:17.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos fugir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:18.60,Main,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:32.79,Main,,0,0,0,,No próximo Owari no Seraph:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.79,0:23:33.97,Main,,0,0,0,,"Yuu e Mika".
