Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.74,0:01:21.46,Owari OP2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\kf25\blur1.95}{\kf30}so{\kf16}no {\kf23}e{\kf25}ga{\kf12}o {\kf19}wo {\kf48}sa{\kf12}ga{\kf25}shi{\kf32}te{\kf4}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.46,0:01:28.42,Owari OP2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\kf18\blur1.95}{\kf19}ko{\kf23}no {\kf31}o{\kf35}mo{\kf20}i {\kf36}ga {\kf37}bo{\kf18}ku{\kf18}ra {\kf32}wo {\kf19}tsu{\kf22}yo{\kf9}ku {\kf30}shi{\kf15}n{\kf18}ji{\kf37}tsu {\kf19}he {\kf18}to {\kf35}mi{\kf38}chi{\kf17}bi{\kf90}ku{\kf40}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.35,0:00:20.77,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Estive sempre sonhando
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.77,0:00:24.94,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Enquanto minhas esperanças despedaçadas atravessavam o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.94,0:00:29.32,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Em busca de diferentes tipos de gentileza
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.32,0:00:35.08,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Olho para o céu e imagino seu sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.08,0:00:41.08,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Desde aquele dia vimos o mundo de forma diferente
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.08,0:00:43.83,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Meus sentimentos transbordam
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.83,0:00:49.71,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Para colocar sua confiança em alguém não é difícil
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.71,0:00:52.76,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Então, essas memórias me dizem
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.76,0:00:58.60,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Continuar por esta estrada escondida na luz e na sombra
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.60,0:01:01.69,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Todos esses sentimentos brilham
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.69,0:01:04.35,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Eu quero te proteger
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.35,0:01:10.07,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Abrace os laços que você sentir em seu coração
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.07,0:01:13.11,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}A hora de se levantar é agora
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.11,0:01:15.87,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Deixe sua tristeza de lado
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.87,0:01:18.74,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Duas almas vão em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.74,0:01:21.46,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Procurando por aquele sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.46,0:01:28.42,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Esses sentimentos nos guiam em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.25,0:22:17.72,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5}A lua se afasta durante o amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.72,0:22:24.35,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}escondendo-se na brilhante luz forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:30.65,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Minhas emoções dão voltas infinitas,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.65,0:22:37.78,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,800)\blur5}enquanto tento conectar um coração ao outro...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:53.25,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Uma oração distante...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.25,0:22:56.84,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Se a paz em que acreditávamos fosse uma mentira
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:23:01.47,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H51AFC3&}enganarei meu coração com tudo que tenho
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.47,0:23:06.27,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}e vestirei a mim mesma com um fogo inspirador!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.27,0:23:09.69,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}O jardim da criação não causa mais que destruição
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.69,0:23:14.28,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}mesmo tendo uma espada de dois gumes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.28,0:23:19.09,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}continue lutando com tudo que tem...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:24.20,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,300)\blur5\3c&HB2B865&}Meu pequeno trapaceiro!
